{"ref":"BDB, בַּוַּי","hw":"בַּוַּי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בַּוַּי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> a Jew of Nehem.’s time <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.18\">Ne 3:18</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנּוּי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.24\">24</a> which prob. read also v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.18\">18</a> (𝔊 Βεδει, Βενει, Βεζερ); cf. further Sm<sup>Listen 12</sup>.","next":"BDB, בּוּךְ","prev":"BDB, בּוּזִי²"}